  <section class="section container">
    <h2>5. FCL vs LCL: the cost crossover</h2>
    <p>
      The Kuwait market’s smaller volume makes the FCL/LCL crossover important. LCL suits small
      consignments but adds a per-CBM rate, minimum charge and CFS handling; FCL becomes stronger as
      the shipment approaches a meaningful share of a container. Neither rate is published, so decide
      from itemised quotes.
    </p>

    <DataTable
