    />
    <SourceList sources={rateSources} title="Sources — FCL vs LCL" />

    <div class="note mt-2">
      <strong>Kuwait small-market effect:</strong> because LCL consolidation volume is lower than
      Dubai, a small shipment may sit longer for consolidation or carry a higher minimum charge.
      Request the CFS cutoff, minimum CBM and next consolidation sailing before choosing LCL.
    </div>
  </section>

