      <p>
        Keep the port choice inside the quote: Shuwaikh (KWSWK) is the general commercial and
        container gateway near Kuwait City, while Shuaiba (KWSHB) is the industrial, petrochemical,
        bulk and project gateway to the south. Confirm the discharge point, terminal allocation and
        destination fees with the carrier and receiver before comparing landed-cost figures.
      </p>
